{"metadata":{"slug":[{"Plain":"Day卷积"},0],"tag":[{"Plain":"百科"},3],"author":[{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},4],"title":[{"Plain":"Day 卷积"},2],"ext":[{"Plain":"md"},1]},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<p>设 $\\mathcal C,\\mathcal D$ 为"},{"Local":{"url":"对称幺半范畴","text":"对称幺半范畴"}},{"Plain":", $\\mathcal D$ 余完备且 $\\otimes_{\\mathcal D}$ 保持每个分量的余极限, 则函子范畴 $\\mathsf{Fun}(\\mathcal C,\\mathcal D)$ 上有一个对称幺半范畴结构, 称为 <strong>Day 卷积</strong>.</p>\n<h2>定义</h2>\n<h3>使用 Kan 扩张</h3>\n<p>对于 $X,Y \\in \\mathsf{Fun}(\\mathcal C,\\mathcal D)$ 记 $X \\boxtimes Y\\in \\mathsf{Fun}(\\mathcal C\\times\\mathcal C,\\mathcal D)$ 为其外张量积, 即\n$$\r\n(X\\boxtimes Y)(c,c') = X(c) \\otimes_{\\mathcal D} Y(c').\r\n$$\n$X$ 与 $Y$ 的 Day 卷积可定义为 $X\\boxtimes Y$ 沿 $\\otimes_{\\mathcal C} \\colon \\mathcal C\\times\\mathcal C \\to \\mathcal C$ 的左 "},{"Local":{"url":"Kan扩张","text":"Kan 扩张"}},{"Plain":":\n$$\r\nX \\otimes_{\\text{Day}} Y := \\operatorname{LKE}_{\\otimes_{\\mathcal C}} (X \\boxtimes Y),\r\n$$\n具体地,\n$$\r\n(X \\otimes_{\\text{Day}} Y)(c) = \\operatorname{colim}_{c' \\otimes c'' \\to c} X(c') \\otimes_{\\mathcal D} Y(c'').\r\n$$</p>\n<h2>性质</h2>\n<p>$\\mathsf{Fun}(\\mathcal C,\\mathcal D)$ 中的"},{"Local":{"url":"交换代数","text":"交换代数"}},{"Plain":"为"},{"Local":{"url":"松幺半函子","text":"松对称幺半函子"}},{"Plain":".</p>\n<p>更一般地, 对任意"},{"Local":{"url":"对称幺半∞-范畴","text":"对称幺半范畴"}},{"Plain":" $\\mathcal C$ 以及 "},{"Local":{"url":"算畴","text":"算畴"}},{"Plain":" $\\mathcal O$, 存在算畴 $\\mathsf{Day}_{\\mathcal C}(\\mathcal O)$ 满足对任意算畴 $\\mathcal P$,\n$$\r\n\\mathsf{Alg}_{\\mathcal P}(\\mathsf{Day}_{\\mathcal C}(\\mathcal O))\\simeq \\mathsf{Alg}_{\\mathcal P\\times_{\\mathsf{Fin}_*}\\mathcal C^\\otimes}(\\mathcal O).\r\n$$\n换言之, $\\mathsf{Day}_{\\mathcal C}$ 是 $-\\times_{\\mathsf{Fin}_*}\\mathcal C^\\otimes$ 的右伴随.</p>\n"}]}}